  "title": "Entocycle and EnviroFlight partner to develop black soldier fly breeding technology",
  "summary": "Entocycle, the UK’s leading insect technology company, announced today a collaboration with EnviroFlight, the largest producer of insect-based ingredients for animal and plant nutrition in North America, to develop and trial the Entosight® Neo, Entocycle’s black soldier fly (BSF) breeding technology",
